# TR Necrom: "Wake for the Waves" (TR_m2_Nm_Wake), the mercy ending. The old man Vanryth Adrano on a rock northeast
# of Necrom sends the player away (greeting: 5). A Dark Elf commoner outside the Temple, Satheri Indaram, passes on the
# rumor that he is a ghost ("Vanryth Adrano": 6); his next greeting denies it (20). The Sodden Ledger in the Corroded
# Shipwreck names the Orphaned Dancer (TR_m2_q_Nm_Wake_logscript: 21). The harbormaster Ethaso Athones remembers it
# (30) and, paid 100 gold ("I can offer you 100 gold for your time." 2), fetches the logs (40,
# TR_m2_q_Nm_Wake_timer: 50 a day later). The logs name the survivor (Continue 1: 60), Travin Benelas at Romithren
# Monastery, who knows Vanryth's name ("Do you know Vanryth Adrano?" 1: 70). Vanryth confesses (Continue 1: 80) and
# is let go ("I will let you go free." 4: 85, a ring and Enchant); Travin, told, closes it (101).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the travel, sleep for the day's wait.
# Refs carry TR_Mainland's slot 09: 096E2C8F the ledger.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_nm_drunk_shirt --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case nm_wake_start
run
player->Position 376114 -73490 1900 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano
until 120 GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 5
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3808 3850 15707 0 "Necrom, Satheri Indaram's House"
until 600 "TR_m2_Satheri Indaram"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Satheri Indaram
ask Vanryth Adrano
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 6
bye
run
player->Position 376114 -73490 1900 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 20
bye
end

case nm_wake_ledger
run
player->PositionCell 3818 4566 14421 0 "Corroded Shipwreck"
wait 150
activate 096E2C8F
close Book Menu
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 21
end

case nm_wake_ethaso
run
player->PositionCell 6911 400 14990 0 "Necrom, Docks Administration"
until 600 "TR_m2_Ethaso Athones"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Ethaso Athones
ask Orphaned Dancer
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 30
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 40
bye
run
ShowRestMenu
sleep 24
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 50
talk TR_m2_Ethaso Athones
ask Orphaned Dancer
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 60
bye
end

case nm_wake_travin
run
player->PositionCell 4037 4150 15823 0 "Romithren Monastery, Scriptorium"
until 600 "TR_m3_Travin Benelas"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m3_Travin Benelas
ask Orphaned Dancer
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 70
bye
end

case nm_wake_vanryth
run
player->Position 376114 -73490 1900 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Vanryth Adrano
ask Orphaned Dancer
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 80
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 85
expect player->GetItemCount "ring of wildfire" == 1
end

case nm_wake_done
run
player->PositionCell 4037 4150 15823 0 "Romithren Monastery, Scriptorium"
until 600 "TR_m3_Travin Benelas"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m3_Travin Benelas
ask Orphaned Dancer
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Wake == 101
bye
end
